 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">11,882</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">77<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">686</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">1,733</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">77<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R24</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">684</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">77<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">630</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">109</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">77<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">3,479</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">138.1</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">75w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,700</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">67.5</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">75w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">2,577</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">42.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">75w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,514</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">25.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">75w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">Simple APU case designed for integrated graphics builds. The ABit I29 is a very compact travel-oriented case with support for a single 3.5&quot; or 2.5&quot; SSD on the front and side, plus additional 2.5&quot; drives at the bottom or top. No official case fan support but modding in small 40-50mm fans may be possible. The Onda B650PLUS-ITX motherboard is budget-friendly with adequate VRMs for low-power CPUs but weaker PCIe lanes. No onboard WiFi or M.2 heatsink, requiring separate purchases. The Ryzen 5 8600G provides solid performance for e-sports, arcade gaming, and productivity work. Stress testing pushed the CPU to 77W with throttling from the BIOS and board limitations, keeping temperatures under 90C. This is a decent compact build suitable for work, multimedia, and light gaming in a travel-friendly package. Bigger than a NUC or Deskmini STX but offers better expandability.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">11,882</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:29%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->71<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">154.3</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">8<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">67.5<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:25%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabu