 with throttling from the BIOS and board limitations, keeping temperatures under 90C. This is a decent compact build suitable for work, multimedia, and light gaming in a travel-friendly package. Bigger than a NUC or Deskmini STX but offers better expandability.\"}]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Performance\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\",\"children\":\"CPU — CB23 Multi\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\",\"children\":\"11,882\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"29%\"}}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\",\"children\":[\"top \",71,\"%\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium text-ink\",\"children\":154.3}],\" pts/w\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium text-ink\",\"children\":[8,\"°C\"]}],\" headroom\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\",\"children\":\"GPU — Heaven 1080p\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\",\"children\":[\"67.5\",\" \",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\",\"children\":\"f